<title>CHINA: China 1996 rice exports soar.</title>
<headline>China 1996 rice exports soar.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's rice exports reached 260,000 tonnes in 1996, up from the year-earlier's 50,000 tonnes, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rice exports in December alone were 10,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China's rice imports slumped 53.6 percent to 760,000 tonnes in 1996, compared with the same year-earlier period, the figures showed. China imported 1.64 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>Imports in December alone were 110,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
